      <Docs>
        <summary>Indicates that contacts associated with this account are synchronized from a cloud account to the device.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Indicates that contacts associated with this account are synchronized from a cloud account to the device. Local changes (creations, edits, deletions) are generally not uploaded to the cloud via this sync mechanism. A two-way sync account has both ATTRIBUTE_SYNC_MODE_UP_SYNC and ATTRIBUTE_SYNC_MODE_DOWN_SYNC attributes.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/provider/ContactsContract.Settings.AccountAttributes#ATTRIBUTE_SYNC_MODE_DOWN_SYNC" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.provider.ContactsContract.Settings.AccountAttributes.ATTRIBUTE_SYNC_MODE_DOWN_SYNC</code>.</a></format></para>
